[1mConfigurations.[22m There is exactly one. [38;5;10mtranslation/Cargo.toml[0m declares no [38;5;10m[features][0m section, and [38;5;10mc_src/CMakeLists.txt[0m has no [38;5;10moption()[0m calls or [38;5;10mtarget_compile_definitions[0m — just [38;5;10madd_library(driver SHARED src/driver.c)[0m. So the only combination is the empty/default one, which I verified with an automated enumeration script rather than assuming. [38;5;10mcargo check --no-default-features --features ''[0m passes with no errors, so no [38;5;10m#[cfg(feature = ...)][0m gating was required. I extended coverage to both cargo profiles (dev and release) since that was the only remaining build-time axis.[0m[0m
