[1mSymbols.[22m The C [38;5;10m.so[0m exports exactly one dynamic symbol, [38;5;10mdriver[0m; the Rust [38;5;10m.so[0m exports it too. No macro-generated symbols exist in the C source ([38;5;10mmulti_stage[0m and [38;5;10my[0m are [38;5;10mstatic[0m, so they stay local). The [38;5;10mnm -D[0m comparison runs both as a shell diff in the script and as an in-suite assertion.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[1mTests.[22m [38;5;10mtranslation/tests/differential.rs[0m loads both [38;5;10m.so[0m files via [38;5;10mlibloading[0m and calls only the exported [38;5;10mdriver[0m symbol — never Rust code directly. Because [38;5;10mdriver[0m returns [38;5;10mvoid[0m and communicates solely through [38;5;10mprintf[0m, the harness ([38;5;10mtests/common/mod.rs[0m) redirects the process-wide stdout file descriptor, calls through the FFI boundary, [38;5;10mfflush[0mes libc's buffers, and compares raw bytes. Coverage works upward from [38;5;10mmulti_stage[0m's four exit paths (reachable only through [38;5;10mdriver[0m, since it has internal linkage) to [38;5;10mdriver[0m itself: each of the three [38;5;10mgoto fail[0m stages, the success path, an exhaustive −2..4 cube, multi-call sequences that expose the persistent [38;5;10mstatic int y[0m, [38;5;10mi32::MIN[0m/[38;5;10mMAX[0m edges, and 400 deterministic pseudorandom triples.[0m[0m
