[1mTwo harness defects I found and fixed:[22m[0m[0m
[0m[0m
- libtest's parallel progress output was landing inside the captured fd, producing a false mismatch. The test target now uses [38;5;10mharness = false[0m with a single-threaded runner.[0m[0m
